=Video title: {{ $json.title }}
Video URL: {{ $json.youtubeUrl }}

Below is the video's timestamped transcript. Use this transcript as the source for the breakdown. Do not infer content from the URL alone.

TRANSCRIPT:
{{ $json.transcript }}

TASK:
Write a detailed English breakdown of the video. Divide it into meaningful sections. Format each section heading as "### Section name MM:SS" (or H:MM:SS for a video longer than one hour), using timestamps supported by the transcript. Leave a blank line after each heading. Explain the useful content so readers can understand it without watching the video. Use paragraphs, bullets, or numbered lists where helpful. Omit sections that only contain sponsorships, subscription reminders, self-promotion, or calls to action. Link important people, concepts, technologies, and named ideas to Obsidian notes using [[Wiki Link]] syntax where relevant. Do not create links for generic terms or invent concepts. Do not invent sections, timestamps, or claims absent from the transcript.
